#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Header
[GREEN]SKIPPING CUTSCENE & MOVING NPCS[BLACK]

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_AnthraTown_StartOfNewGame_MeetingRivalDownstairs
Go east to Route 17 to get your\nPok\emon.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route17_MeetingHawthorneAndSelene
Return to speak with your mother.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_AnthraTown_ReceivedMothersBlessing
[BLACK]Running Shoes have been enabled and\ncan be toggled with [L_BUTTON].\pReturn to Professor Hawthorne and\nChampion Selene on Route 17.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route17_ChooseStarter
[BLACK]Choose your Starter Pok\emon.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route17_HasChosenStarter
[BLACK]Battle [RIVAL] with your new\nPok\emon!

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route17_HeadToOlenicTown
[BLACK]Visit Professor Hawthorne at\nhis lab in Olenic Town.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_OlenicTown_ReceivingPokedex
[BLACK]Received 10 Pok\e Balls and the\nPok\edex.\pTravel north to Rhodanzi City and\nchallenge the gym.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route3_BattlingRival
[BLACK]Battle [RIVAL] to prove how much\nyou've grown stronger.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route3_InitiatingDexNav
[BLACK]Pursue Team Pluto south into Rubarr\nDesert and reclaim the DexNavs.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_RubarrDesert_StoppingTeamPluto
[BLACK]Team up with [RIVAL] to get the\nDexNavs back from Clancy and Ena.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_RubarrDesert_StoppingTeamPlutoIrene
[BLACK]Team up with [RIVAL] to stop Team\nPluto Admin Irene!

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_RubarrDesert_ReturnDexNavs
[BLACK]Return the DexNavs to Hawthorne's\nAssistant on Route 3.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route3_ReturningDexNavs
[BLACK]Head north to Ferrox Village, passing\nthrough Torma Cave.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route4_ForemanEvent
[BLACK]Head north to Ferrox Village and\nchallenge the gym.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_FerroxVillage_ApproachedGymWhileEmpty
[BLACK]Find the gym leader at the Ferrox\nVillage Library.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_FerroxVillage_AlistairAtTheLibrary
[BLACK]Received HM01 Cut!\nChallenge the Ferrox Village gym.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_DaimynCityGuardHouses_BattleRival
[BLACK]Battle [RIVAL] to prove your\nstrength!

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_DaimynCity_ChallengeGym
[BLACK]Received the Macho Brace.\pChallenge the gym and head east\ntoward Route 11 South.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_DaimynCity_GymPuzzleIntroduction
[BLACK]Received the Coin Case and 500\ncoins.\pEarn 2,000 coins and challenge the\ngym leader.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_TeamUpToStopPluto
[BLACK]Team up with [RIVAL] or Alistair to\nstop Team Pluto.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_StopClancyAndEna
[BLACK]Fight Clancy and Ena to save the\nMega Stone Refiner.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_BattleRonald
[BLACK]Fight Team Pluto Admin Ronald to\nsave the Mega Stone Refiner.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_AfterRonaldBattle
[BLACK]Obtained the Mega Ring.\pFight [RIVAL] to test the power of\nMega Evolution.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_AfterRivalBattle
[BLACK]Received HM02 Fly!\pTravel north to Laplaz Town and\nchallenge the gym.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_LaplazTown_ChallengeCasey
[BLACK]Challenge the gym leader, then\nhead west to Bruccie Village.\pA gym puzzle shortcut has been\nenabled.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route12RestHouse_SeleneAndAlistair
[BLACK]Collect 5 gym badges, then\nhead west to Bruccie Village.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_BruccieVillage_BattlingRival
[BLACK]Battle [RIVAL] to impress Gym Leader\nAbby.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_BruccieVillage_ChallengeAbby
[BLACK]Challenge Gym Leader Abby for her\ngym badge.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_CalicinBayTip
[BLACK]Then, go to Calicin Bay and stop\nTeam Pluto's schemes.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_CalicinBay_StormTeamPlutosBase
[BLACK]Find Team Pluto's headquarters in\nDaimyn City and end their schemes.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_DaimynCity_ConfrontingKurtis
[BLACK]Defeat Pluto Leader Kurtis and put a\nstop to Team Pluto!

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_DaimynCity_SurfToTsarvosa
[BLACK]Received HM03 Surf!\pAcquire the Bruccie Village gym\nbadge and travel to Tsarvosa City.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_Route11South_HeadToMountCarnelidge
[BLACK]Climb Mount Carnelidge and\ninvestigate what's happening.\pMake sure you have collected HM 04\nStrength from Tsarvosa City Stats\lDojo first.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_CarnelidgeVolcanoPeak_StoppingRivalAndAlistair
[BLACK]Stop [RIVAL] and Alistair from\nusing Jirachi's wishes!

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_CarnelidgeVolcanoPeak_SkippingUltraSpace
[BLACK]Skipping Ultra Space events.\nReceived the Houndoominite.\pHead to Uteya Village and challenge\nthe gym.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_UteyaVillage_GoToAscensionTower
[BLACK]Go to Ascension Tower in Daimyn City.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_AscensionTower_GoToVictoryRoad
[BLACK]Go to Victory Road and claim the\nVictory Flag at it's peak.

#org @gText_SkippingCutscenes_VictoryRoad_GoToAscensionTower
[BLACK]Return to Ascension Tower and\nchallenge the Elite Four.
